WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:03.335
MISSION IS.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.369
MARK?

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:07.272
&gt;&gt; Mark: THANKS, JONATHAN.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.408
JUAN HERNANDEZ IS A FORMER

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.409
ADVISOR TO THE MEXICAN PRESIDENT

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.578
AND HE JOINS US NOW.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:16.782
IN WHAT SENSE ARE THESE PEOPLE

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:23.689
IN THE CARAVAN ASYLUM-SEEKERS?

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.491
&gt;&gt; I MET WITH MANY OF THEM.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:29.495
I MET WITH THE 7200 CARAVAN IN

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:32.264
THE STATE THAT I NOW WORK WITH

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:34.266
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLY

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:34.299
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLW

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:34.333
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLR

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:34.366
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLI

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:34.399
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLG

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:34.433
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLW

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:34.466
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLT

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.034
UNDER THE GOVERNOR, SPECIFICALLH

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:36.435
IMMIGRANTS.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:37.202
MOSTLY MEXICAN IMMIGRANTS LIVING

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.238
IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.038
BUT ALSO, IT WAS MY DUTY TO MAKE

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:44.042
SURE THAT WE TREAT IT IN A

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:47.079
HUMANITARIAN WAY, THESE 7,200.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.081
I TELL YOU, YOU SIT DOWN WITH

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.282
THEM FOR A MINUTE AND YOU ARE IN

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:50.582
TEARS.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.352
THESE ARE CHILDREN, THESE ARE

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:53.886
WOMEN.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.988
LET ME FINISH -- THESE ARE

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.856
PEOPLE LOOKING FOR A BETTER WAY

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.858
OF LIFE LIKE YOUR FAMILY AND MY

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:01.994
FAMILY DID MANY YEARS AGO COMING

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:03.262
TO THE UNITED STATES.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.230
&gt;&gt; Mark: I DIDN'T COME AS AN

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.265
ASYLUM'S ACRE, BUT IF I WAS AND

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:06.466
ASYLUM-SEEKERS

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:10.302
, THIS CARAVAN HAS MARCHED

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:13.906
ACROSS TWO NATIONAL FRONTIERS.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.240
IT MARCHED INTO GUATEMALA

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.075
ILLEGALLY AND THEN IT MARCHED

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:17.943
INTO MEXICO ILLEGALLY.

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:20.279
IF YOU ARE AN ASYLUM-SEEKER, I

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:24.650
AM SUPPOSED TO SEEK ASYLUM IN

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:25.884
THE FIRST SAFE COUNTRY I COME

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:26.151
TO?

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:30.389
&gt;&gt; MY FRIEND, WE ALL KNOW THE

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.690
UNITED STATES IS TODAY THE MOST

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:32.524
POWERFUL NATION IN THE WORLD.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.359
IT IS THEIR DREAM OF MANY, MANY

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.595
PEOPLE WHO ARE JUST TRYING TO

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.031
GET OUT OF DIRE POVERTY,

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:39.965
VIOLENCE, TO BE ABLE TO REACH

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.100
THE UNITED STATES AND TO BE A

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:43.268
BLESSING, AS THEY ARE THE

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:44.503
IMMIGRANTS TO THIS NATION.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:45.771
THAT'S THE DREAM.

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.306
THEY ARE COMING TO THE

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:47.973
UNITED STATES, AND THEY ARE

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:50.475
SEEKING ASYLUM.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:51.443
THEY ARE NOT INNOVATING.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:56.315
IT'S SUCH A SMALL NUMBER.

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:57.015
&gt;&gt; Mark: WAIT A MINUTE -- YOU

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.884
ARE NOW SAYING THAT A DREAM IS A

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.519
BASIS FOR ASYLUM.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.954
I MIGHT HAVE A DREAM --

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:02.721
&gt;&gt; DEFINITELY.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.122
&gt;&gt; Mark: I MIGHT HAVE A DREAM

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:06.858
TO LIVE IN BARBRA STREISAND

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:07.726
HOUSE, DOESN'T MEAN I HAVE A

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:09.695
RIGHT TO MOVE INTO HER GUEST

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.496
BEDROOM.

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:13.832
&gt;&gt; IF YOU ARE A BLOCK AWAY FROM

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.268
HER HOME AND YOU ARE BEING

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:17.369
ATTACKED AND BEING AND YOUR

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.571
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY H

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:19.605
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY V

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:19.838
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY E

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:19.871
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY I

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:20.038
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY S

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:20.072
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY T

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:20.138
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY O

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:20.172
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY J

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:20.205
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY I

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:20.439
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY N

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:20.639
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY A

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:20.672
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY G

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:20.706
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY N

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:21.240
CHILDREN, THE ONLY CHANCE THEY G

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.342
AND YOU CAN'T EVEN FEED THEM,

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:25.677
YOU WOULD BE KNOCKING ON THAT

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:26.878
MOVIE STARS, SAYING, IS THERE

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:28.847
SOME WAY THAT I CAN BE HERE IN

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.482
YOUR HOME AND WORK FOR YOU?

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:31.617
&gt;&gt; Mark: SHE STILL WOULDN'T

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:33.318
LET ME END.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:33.885
YOU KNOW THAT.

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:36.288
&gt;&gt; SHE WOULD.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:36.855
SHE WOULD.

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:38.490
&gt;&gt; Mark: HERE'S THE THING, YOU

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.992
TALK ABOUT ALL THE CHILDREN,

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:44.363
THERE ARE WOMEN BEING RAPED,

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:48.500
THESE ARE OVERWHELMINGLY YOUNG

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:48.767
MEN.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:49.434
WHAT KIND OF ASYLUM-SEEKERS

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:51.136
LEAVE THE OLD AND THE SICK, AND

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:53.639
THE KIDS, AND THE WOMEN FOLK

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.641
BACK IN GUATEMALA, OR WHEREVER,

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.843
AND IT'S JUST THE YOUNG MEN WHO

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:58.610
COME ACROSS THE FRONTIER?

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:01.280
IT'S OVERWHELMINGLY YOUNG MEN.

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:04.983
&gt;&gt; YES, PROBABLY ABOUT 75% TO

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:05.751
80% ARE YOUNG MEN, YOU ARE

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:06.051
RIGHT.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.920
THEY ARE THE ONES WHO WANT TO DO

00:03:08.921 --> 00:03:11.657
BETTER FOR THEIR FAMILIES AND

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:13.325
THEY ARE LEAVING DESPERATELY.

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:16.862
THEY SEE NO WAY THAT THEY CAN BE

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.664
ABLE TO SURVIVE IN SOME OF THE

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:21.033
PLACES WHERE THEY COME FROM.

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:23.235
&gt;&gt; Mark: NO, NO, NO.

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:25.504
EVERYONE WITH A DREAM, THERE ARE

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:26.238
7 BILLION PEOPLE ON THE PLANET

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:28.640
AND AS YOU SAY, AMERICA IS THE

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:29.841
MOST POWERFUL, WEALTHIEST, ALL

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:30.309
THE REST OF IT.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:35.681
THE FACT THAT THAT GIVES

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.516
6.5 BILLION PEOPLE THE RIGHT TO

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:38.183
MOVE TO THE UNITED STATES?

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:40.052
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT THAT IT IS A

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.019
RIGHT -- ALTHOUGH MANY WOULD

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.721
CLAIM THAT IT IS A HUMAN RIGHT

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.690
THAT IF YOU ARE IN A DIRE

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:47.059
SITUATION, YOU ARE GOING TO TRY,

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.294
EVEN IF YOU HAVE TO BREAK SOME

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:50.662
ADMINISTRATIVE RULES.

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:53.632
THEY HAVE NOT COMMITTED CRIMES.

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:54.499
THEY ARE JUST SEEKING ASYLUM.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.501
&gt;&gt; Mark: YOU ARE NOW START OF

00:03:56.502 --> 00:03:58.103
THE STATE GOVERNMENT IN MEXICO.

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:00.238
&gt;&gt; YES, SIR.

00:04:00.239 --> 00:04:00.605
PROBABLY.

00:04:00.606 --> 00:04:01.740
&gt;&gt; Mark: WHAT IS WRONG WITH

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.642
YOUR ESTATE IF THEY JUST WANT A

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:04.443
BETTER LIFE?

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:06.345
WHY CAN'T THEY MOVE TO YOUR

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:06.645
STATE?

00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:08.647
YOUR ESTATE IS BETTER THAN

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:09.648
HONDURAS, WHEREVER THEY COME

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:09.948
FROM.

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:12.651
&gt;&gt; YES, IT IS.

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:13.885
THE DREAM FOR THEM IS THE

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:14.319
UNITED STATES.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:18.223
THERE IS A WONDERFUL ARTICLE BY

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:20.225
A PRIEST FROM HONDURAS AND HE

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:21.693
CALLED AT THE BOIL OVER.

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:23.362
I SUGGEST MANY OF YOUR VIEWERS

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:23.895
READ IT.

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:26.465
I THINK IT CAME OUT IN

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:27.099
"THE NEW YORK TIMES," THE

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:27.632
TRANSLATION.

00:04:27.633 --> 00:04:29.434
HE SAID THESE ARE PEOPLE, THEY

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:30.669
ARE NOT ORGANIZED, THEY WEREN'T

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.337
PAID BY EVERYONE.

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:35.073
DOZENS WERE GOING TO DESPERATELY

00:04:35.074 --> 00:04:36.808
LEAVE THE COUNTRY AND IT JUST

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:37.876
BOILED OVER.

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:38.610
IT LITERALLY THOUSANDS SAID WE

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:40.846
CAN TAKE IT NO LONGER, WE MUST

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:42.447
SEEK A BETTER LIFE.

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:44.649
IT IS HAPPENING ALL OVER THE

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:44.950
WORLD.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:46.051
TODAY THERE ARE TWO AND A HALF

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:47.452
MILLION PEOPLE GOING FROM ONE

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:48.153
COUNTRY TO ANOTHER TRYING TO

00:04:48.154 --> 00:04:49.855
FIND A BETTER LIFE.

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:51.757
WE HAVE TO DEAL WITH IT.

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:57.262
WE MUST BE A COUNTRY OF LAWS --

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:59.698
MEXICO AND THE UNITED STATES --

00:04:59.699 --> 00:05:01.733
AND PEOPLE ARE BEING TESTED.

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:02.434
OTHER NATIONS HAVE NOT PASSED

00:05:02.435 --> 00:05:04.302
THE TEST.

00:05:04.303 --> 00:05:06.371
WE NEED TO PASS THIS TEST OF

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:09.274
BEING HUMANITARIAN AND DECENCY

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:09.875
TO THESE PEOPLE.

00:05:09.876 --> 00:05:11.910
&gt;&gt; Mark: WHY IS IT IN THE

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:13.044
INTEREST OF THESE OTHER

00:05:13.045 --> 00:05:15.080
COUNTRIES FOR ALL OF THEIR MOST

00:05:15.081 --> 00:05:16.415
TALENTED PEOPLE TO MOVE TO THE

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:19.484
UNITED STATES OR WESTERN EUROPE?

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:22.654
WHY IS IT IN THE INTEREST OF

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:23.889
GUATEMALA OR ANYWHERE ELSE TO BE

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:26.858
DENUDED OF ITS MOST TALENTED

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:27.492
PEOPLE?

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:30.028
&gt;&gt; WELL, SURE, IT'S MOSTLY

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:30.462
ECONOMIC.

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:31.997
IN THE UNITED STATES -- AND I'M

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.298
SURE YOU DO -- READ THE

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:36.067
STATISTICS, THE UNITED STATES IS

00:05:36.068 --> 00:05:37.269
GROWING AT LESS THAN 1%.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.805
THE UNITED STATES NEEDS ABOUT

00:05:39.806 --> 00:05:42.340
350,000 NEW PEOPLE EVERY YEAR.

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:45.043
THESE 10,000 ARE GOOD PEOPLE.

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:47.446
I MET THEM --

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:50.248
&gt;&gt; Mark: THEY MAY BE GOOD

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:50.615
PEOPLE --

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:53.084
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE DOING GREAT,

00:05:53.085 --> 00:05:54.486
FINANCIALLY, BUT THERE DREAM IS

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:55.353
TO COME TO THE UNITED STATES.

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:56.621
&gt;&gt; Mark: THERE ARE PLENTY OF

00:05:56.622 --> 00:05:57.456
GOOD PEOPLE.

00:05:57.457 --> 00:05:59.858
IF YOU GO TO THESE AIRPORTS, YOU

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.059
GET YOUR MAIL ORDER ON A

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:01.827
MACHINE.

00:06:01.828 --> 00:06:05.531
NOBODY NEEDS PEOPLE ANYMORE,

